{"id":"ebenfalls","lemma":"ebenfalls","pos":"adv","rank":1480,"glosses":["also, likewise, as well"],"ipa":"/ˈeːbn̩fals/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/b/ba/De-ebenfalls.ogg/De-ebenfalls.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Er wird ebenfalls gehen.","en":"He will also go.","words":[{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"to become","l":"werden"},null,{"g":"to go, to walk"}]},{"text":"Diese Aussage ist ebenfalls falsch.","en":"This statement is false as well.","words":[{"g":"this one, this","l":"dieser"},{"g":"proposition"},{"g":"is","l":"sein"},null,{"g":"false"}]},{"text":"Ich hoffe, dass du ebenfalls glücklich bist.","en":"I hope you're happy, too.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to hope","l":"hoffen"},{"g":"that"},{"g":"you"},null,{"g":"happy"},{"g":"are","l":"sein"}]},{"text":"Wir stimmen ebenfalls zu.","en":"We agree as well.","words":[{"g":"we"},{"g":"to be right"},null,{"g":"to / too"}]},{"text":"Das ist ebenfalls irrelevant.","en":"That's also irrelevant.","words":[{"g":"the / that"},{"g":"is","l":"sein"},null,{"g":"irrelevant"}]}]}